[Poke:Infinite Lives]
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$C062(#N$C062),#N$00</code>
</div>

Removes the instruction which would otherwise decrease #R$A263.

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$C05F(#N$C05F)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGhl,#R$A263(#N$A263)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$C05F(#N$C062)</td>
      <td class="instruction">DEC (#REGhl)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$C05F(#N$C063)</td>
      <td class="instruction">JP M,#R$C0B6(#N$C0B6)</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

To:

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$C05F(#N$C05F)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGhl,#R$A263(#N$A263)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$C05F(#N$C062)</td>
      <td class="instruction">NOP</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$C05F(#N$C063)</td>
      <td class="instruction">JP M,#R$C0B6(#N$C0B6)</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
